<title>USA: Syncor says investments to dampen Q4, '97.</title>
<headline>Syncor says investments to dampen Q4, '97.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syncorp International Corp said investing in new strategic business opportunities had a dampening effect on third quarter operating results as it will for the fourth quarter of 1996 and 1997.</p>
<p>The company said these investments were for international and domestic expansion, core business improvements and positron emission tomography (PET).</p>
